@startuml
!include ./nora-medlink-style.puml
title Figure 3.14 — Nora MedLink State Transition Diagram: Medical Report

[*] --> PENDING : Upload request accepted
PENDING --> OCR_PROCESSING : File stored
OCR_PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : OCR and AI analysis succeed
OCR_PROCESSING --> NEEDS_REVIEW : OCR returns weak or incomplete text
OCR_PROCESSING --> FAILED : OCR service error
COMPLETED --> REVIEWED : Patient edits or confirms OCR text
NEEDS_REVIEW --> REVIEWED : Patient saves corrected text
FAILED --> PENDING : Regenerate OCR requested
REVIEWED --> COMPLETED : AI summary regenerated
COMPLETED --> DELETED : Patient deletes report
REVIEWED --> DELETED : Patient deletes report
FAILED --> DELETED : Patient deletes report
DELETED --> [*]
@enduml
